    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wathi kuSawuli: INkosi yangithuma ukuba ngikugcobe ube yinkosi yabantu bayo uIsrayeli; ngakhoke ake ulalele amazwi eNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yamabandla ithi: Ngizatshaya amaAmaleki ngalokho akwenza kuIsrayeli, ukulwa laye endleleni ekuphumeni kwakhe eGibithe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.17.8+EXO.17.9+EXO.17.10+EXO.17.11+EXO.17.12+EXO.17.13+EXO.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 17:8–14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.17+DEU.25.18+DEU.25.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dute 25:17–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hambake uyehlasela amaAmaleki, uqede konke alakho; ungabi lasihawu, kodwa ubulale abesilisa labesifazana, izingane lensane ezimunyayo, inkomo lezimvu, amakamela labobabhemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngakho uSawuli wasebiza abantu, wababala eTelayimi, baba yizinkulungwane ezingamakhulu amabili abahamba ngenyawo, lezinkulungwane ezilitshumi zabantu bakoJuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wafika emzini wamaAmaleki, wacathama esigodini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wathi kumaKeni: Sukani, liphume phakathi kwamaAmaleki, funa ngilibhubhise kanye lawo; ngoba laba lomusa kubo bonke abantu bakoIsrayeli ekuphumeni kwabo eGibithe. Ngakho amaKeni aphuma phakathi kwamaAmaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wawahlula amaAmaleki, kusukela eHavila kwaze kwafika eShuri elingasempumalanga kweGibithe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamthumba uAgagi inkosi yamaAmaleki; bonke abantu wababulala ngomkhonto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa uSawuli lempi yakhe kabambulalanga uAgagi, lezimvu lenkomo ezinhle lezinonisiweyo, lamawundlu, lakho konke okuhle; kabathandanga ukukuqeda lokho, kodwa konke okwakudeleleka kungelamsebenzi bakuqeda nya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilizwi leNkosi lafika kuSamuweli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lathi: Sengizisola ngokuthi ngambeka uSawuli waba yinkosi; ngoba udelile ukungilandela, kayenzanga imilayo yami. USamuweli wathukuthela, ubusuku bonke wakhala eNkosini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kusisa uSamuweli wavuka ekuseni ukuhlangabeza uSawuli; kodwa watshelwa ukuthi uSawuli usehambile waya eKarmeli; kwathiwa uthe esezimisele khona insika, wasedlulela eGiligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wamfumana uSawuli, uSawuli wathi kuye: INkosi ikubusise; sengilenzile ilizwi layo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasesithi: Kutshoni pho lokhu ukukhala kwezimvu endlebeni zami, lalokhu ukukhala kwenkomo engikuzwayo na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wathi: Abantu babuye lazo kuwo amaAmaleki; ngoba kabazibulalanga izimvu lenkomo ezinhle ukuze bahlabele iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho; ezinye siziqedile nya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasesithi kuSawuli: Kahle, ngikutshele ukuthi iNkosi itheni kimi kulobubusuku. Yena wathi: Khuluma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasesithi: Lanxa wawuzibona umncinyane, khathesi usuyinhloko yezizwe zakoIsrayeli, leNkosi yakugcoba waba yinkosi yakoIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi ikuthumile emsebenzini wayo yathi: Hamba uyeqeda nya izoni, amaAmaleki, ulwe lawo aze aphele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phoke, kungani ungalilalelanga ilizwi leNkosi na? Kungani uzithathela impango, wenza okubi emehlweni eNkosi na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USawuli wathi kuSamuweli: Impela ngililalele ilizwi leNkosi, ngiyile emsebenzini iNkosi ebingithume wona, ngibuyile loAgagi inkosi yamaAmaleki, ngiwaqedile nya amaAmaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kodwa abantu bathathe kuyo impango izimvu lenkomo, okuhle kokuqalekisiweyo, ukuba bahlabele iNkosi uNkulunkulu wakho eGiligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "USamuweli wasesithi:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
